  "reason": "The existing evidence from config_016 shows moderate multimodal performance but lacks comparison to single-modality baselines. This experiment tests a pure RNA-only singleprofile baseline (config_001) to directly compare performance against the multimodal config_016. It isolates the impact of multimodality versus single-modality, which is critical for understanding if combining modalities provides meaningful benefits. This comparison addresses key uncertainty about the baseline performance of RNA data alone, which is necessary before evaluating more complex multimodal designs."
